@startuml
!include puml-style.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Unconfigured
Unconfigured --> Configuring : launch
Unconfigured --> Configuring : attach
Configuring --> Stopped : configuration complete
Stopped --> Running : continue, step
Running --> Stopped : breakpoint, watchpoint, halt
Stopped --> Terminated : disconnect
Running --> Terminated : disconnect
Terminated --> [*]
note bottom of Configuring
  On the attach path the direct
  path is absent, so trace, live
  memory observation and peripheral
  inspection are unavailable.
end note
@enduml
